{"id":18064,"name":"Saginaw County","slug":"saginaw-county","state":"Michigan","code":"MI","program":null,"sourceUrl":"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-deed/tax-deed-states/michigan-tax-deed-sales-property-deals-90-off/saginaw-county/","lastUpdated":"2026-07-20T14:50:42","facts":{"taxSaleType":"Tax Deed Sale","typicalSaleDate":"Varies; check tax-sale.info for updates","bidProcedure":"Premium Bid","deposit":"$1,000","extra":[{"label":"Sale Contact","value":"Saginaw County Treasurer"},{"label":"Auction Site","value":"Michigan Public Land Auction"},{"label":"County Website","value":"County Website"}]},"bodyHtml":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"cifvN5hB2wOE1Cq9XM4oH6gRaU3GermDzJ08KkpSxbTQnusIAVYtPydWLFZ7j\"><iframe title=\"Seize Up to 90% Discounts on Real Estate Gems - Saginaw County - Michigan Tax Deed Investing\" width=\"1170\" height=\"658\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/t94Vw3o0khY?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Get Dustin Hahn’s Tax Lien and Deed FREE Mini-Course</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Seize-40-90%-Discounts-on-Real-Estate-Gems-in-Saginaw-County,-Michigan---Tax-Deed-Investing\">Seize 40-90% Discounts on Properties in Saginaw County, Michigan</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Looking to invest in real estate at a fraction of the cost? Saginaw County, <a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-deed/tax-deed-states/michigan-tax-deed-sales-property-deals-90-off/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Michigan</mark></a>, offers incredible opportunities with discounts ranging from 40% to 90% off through their tax foreclosure sales. Everything you need to participate is available online at <a href=\"https://www.tax-sale.info/\">Michigan Public Land Auction</a>. From registration to bidding in both minimum bid and no-reserve auctions, the process is straightforward and fully accessible online.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"How-to-Participate\">How to Participate in Saginaw County Tax Sale Auction</h3>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Registration:</strong></li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Start by registering an online user account at tax-sale.info at least 48 hours before your desired auction. You must also submit a $1,000 deposit via credit card pre-authorization or certified funds.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"2\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Bidding:</strong></li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Start Bidding:</strong> Bidding opens 30 days before the auction, and you can place and adjust your bids until the auction begins at 10 AM.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Auction Day:</strong> On the day of the auction, which typically runs until 7 PM, the highest bidder wins the property. If you win, you&#8217;ll receive an email with payment instructions.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Payment:</strong> You must pay the winning bid amount, a 10% premium, the current summer’s taxes, and a $30 deed fee within five business days. Payment options include wire transfer, certified check, or card.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"3\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Final Steps:</strong></li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Remember, all sales are final, and properties are sold as-is. It&#8217;s crucial to research the properties beforehand to understand what you&#8217;re purchasing.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Important-Details\">Important Details</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Saginaw-County-Michigan.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Saginaw-County-Michigan-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Saginaw-County-Michigan-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Saginaw-County-Michigan-768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Saginaw-County-Michigan-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Saginaw-County-Michigan-32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Saginaw-County-Michigan.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Saginaw-County-Michigan.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Saginaw-County-Michigan-541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Saginaw-County-Michigan-296x197.png 296w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Saginaw-County-Michigan-768x512.png 768w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Saginaw-County-Michigan-20x13.png 20w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Saginaw-County-Michigan-32x21.png 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" class=\"wp-image-18083 sp-