s</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Research Thoroughly:</strong> Ensure you inspect the properties and understand any existing liens or zoning regulations.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Monitor Deadlines:</strong> Keep track of bidding and payment deadlines to avoid disqualification.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Understand the Market:</strong> Familiarize yourself with local real estate trends to make informed bids.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Frequently-Asked-Questions\">Frequently Asked Questions</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>What happens if the property owner redeems the lien?</strong><br>If the property owner pays off the lien before the auction, the county removes the property from the sale.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Can I inspect the properties before bidding?</strong><br>We recommend conducting physical inspections, but you must obtain written permission from the county to enter any structures.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>What payment methods are accepted in the Saginaw County Tax Sale?</strong><br>Accepted payment methods include wire transfer, certified check, and card.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Are there any additional fees?</strong><br>Yes, besides your bid amount, you&#8217;ll need to pay a 10% premium, current summer&#8217;s taxes, and a $30 deed fee.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>What if I miss the payment deadline?</strong><br>Failure to pay within five business days will result in the forfeiture of your deposit and the property.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>For more detailed information and resources, visit the <a href=\"https://www.saginawcounty.com/departments/treasurer/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Saginaw County Treasurer’s Office</mark></a> or the <a href=\"https://www.tax-sale.info/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Michigan Public Land Auction site</mark></a><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">.</mark></p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Need-a-Hand?\">Need a Hand?</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>If you need assistance with tax lien investing, feel free to reach out. You can <a href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">book a call</mark></a><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\"> </mark>or access <a href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">free resources</mark></a> to help you navigate the process.</p>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n<p><em>Sign up or log in to view the full content.</em></p><div id=\"popup-overlay\"></div><div id=\"signup-popup\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 20px;\"><h4>Get Instant Free Access To The Training Vault Now</h4><p>Learn how to get 18-36% returns on your investment and buy property for as little as $500 with tax lien and tax deeds.</p><div class=\"video-container\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; margin: 20px 0;\"><iframe src=\"https://youtube.com/embed/FkB-M8RaSHo\" allowfullscreen style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 560px; height: 315px; border: none; border-radius: 8px;\"></iframe></div><div class=\"button-container\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\"><button style=\"padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Sign Up for FREE Access</button><button style=\"padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Already a Member? Login</button></div></div>","upcomingCount":0}